Strategic Framework for DevSecOps
Lab Objectives
By the end of this lab, students will be able to:

• Understand the fundamental concepts of DevSecOps strategic frameworks • Apply Wardley Mapping techniques to visualize DevSecOps value chains and dependencies • Utilize the Cynefin Framework to categorize and approach different types of DevSecOps challenges • Create strategic maps that inform decision-making in DevSecOps implementations • Analyze organizational readiness for DevSecOps adoption using strategic frameworks • Develop actionable insights for DevSecOps transformation initiatives

Prerequisites
Before starting this lab, students should have:

• Basic understanding of software development lifecycle concepts • Familiarity with DevOps principles and practices • Basic knowledge of security concepts in software development • Ability to use command-line interfaces • Understanding of organizational change management concepts

