Step 2: Learn Wardley Map Components
Wardley Maps consist of four key elements:

• Value Chain (Y-axis): Shows what users need, from visible user needs at the top to invisible components at the bottom • Evolution (X-axis): Shows how components evolve from Genesis → Custom → Product → Commodity • Components: The building blocks of your system • Dependencies: Lines showing how components depend on each other

